sequenceDiagram
actor Student
participant UI as Login browser
participant API as AuthController
participant S as AuthService
participant DB as UserRepository
Student->>UI: Enter email and password
UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login
API->>S: login(request)
S->>DB: find account
DB-->>S: user / missing
S->>S: verify password hash and active status
alt valid account
S-->>API: safe user DTO
API->>API: set session userId
API-->>UI: 200 + session cookie
UI->>UI: remember current user and navigate home
else invalid account
API-->>UI: error status and message
UI-->>Student: inline feedback; retry enabled
end
